# TAOCP 3rd ed., first printing, vol.2, pp.337,339-340.
# Numeric local labels renamed. ABS=1:5 is an existing field alias.
# *_END labels stop the interpreter on fall-through; not book instructions.
A01 A LDX U
A02 - JMP ATEST
A03 ALOOP STX V
A04 - SRAX 5
A05 - DIV V
A06 ATEST LDA V
A07 - JXNZ ALOOP
Aend A_END CON 0
B02 B ENT1 0
B03 - LDX U
B04 - LDAN V
B05 - JMP BODD
B06 BHALVE SRB 1
B07 - INC1 1
B08 - STX U
B09 - STA V(ABS)
B10 BODD JXO B4
B11 B2 JAE BHALVE
B12 - LDA U
B13 B3 SRB 1
B14 B4 JAE B3
B15 B5 JAN BNEG
B16 - STA U
B17 - SUB V
B18 - JMP BTEST
B19 BNEG STA V(ABS)
B20 B6 ADD U
B21 BTEST JANZ B3
B22 - LDA U
B23 - ENTX 0
B24 - SLB 0,1
Bend B_END CON 0
dataU U CON 0
dataV V CON 0
